GPT-SoVITS
============

The native GPT-SoVITS V1, V2, V2Pro, and V2ProPlus classic-S2 graphs and
staged training equations are adapted from:

  https://github.com/RVC-Boss/GPT-SoVITS
  revision d523079fc05d9a8028d6085bffe4a2757c32abb6

Copyright (c) 2024 RVC-Boss
Licensed under the MIT License.

The residual-vector-quantizer state topology derives from EnCodec:

  https://github.com/facebookresearch/encodec

Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.
Licensed under the MIT License.

The S2 generator, flow, posterior encoder, and discriminator equations derive
from VITS:

  https://github.com/jaywalnut310/vits
  revision 2e561ba58618d021b5b8323d3765880f7e0ecfdb

Copyright (c) 2020 Jaehyeon Kim
Licensed under the MIT License.

The S1 autoregressive semantic model is adapted through GPT-SoVITS from
SoundStorm and references VALL-E. VoiceHub retains GPT-SoVITS's released
checkpoint namespace and source-faithful non-DPO objective; it does not import
either project at runtime.

